msgid "ArduPilot does not currently configure UBlox F9P GPS constellations. User must assure that the GPS is properly configured for his region and application. See :ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:44
